Cypress (15 and 16) helper for this template — in a Cypress suite, use it as written:
Facts:
  • hidden copies: each plan card also exists for other products — scoped by div[data-plan-type="teams"]
  • no attribute carries the plan name on every card (data-plan-name is empty on "Team") — a card is found by its toggle input's aria-label, else by its exact visible title
  • "Team Pro" shares the "Team" card behind a toggle: hidden radio inputs operated by their labels — showPlan(title) switches it
  • each card holds a hidden Choose and price per toggle state — act on the displayed one
  • the "Volume" card has no Choose button or price
```js
const planCards = () => cy.get('div[data-plan-type="teams"] div.simplification-card');

const isPlan = (card, title) =>
  Cypress.$(card).find(`input.card-toggle__input[aria-label="${title}"]`).length > 0 ||
  Cypress.$(card).find('h3.simplification-card__title').text().trim() === title;

const planCard = (title) => planCards().filter((_, card) => isPlan(card, title));

const showPlan = (title) =>
  planCard(title).then(($card) => {
    const $toggle = $card.find(`input.card-toggle__input[aria-label="${title}"]`);
    if ($toggle.length && !$toggle.prop('checked')) cy.wrap($card).find(`label[for="${$toggle.attr('id')}"]`).click();
  });

const choose = (title) => planCard(title).find('input[type="submit"][value="Choose"]').filter(':visible');
const price = (title) => planCard(title).find('div.simplification-card__price').filter(':visible');
```
